      "instance_name": "inspiration_porn",
      "label": "Inspiration Porn",
      "description": "A harmful trope that portrays people with disabilities as inspirational solely because of their perceived 'overcoming' of adversity, reducing their value to their resilience rather than their individuality. This concept is central to understanding the meme's framing of Lizzie Velasquez as a motivational speaker, which may unintentionally or intentionally reinforce societal stigma around physical difference.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
