      "instance_name": "motivational_speaker",
      "label": "Motivational Speaker",
      "description": "A person who gives speeches designed to inspire, encourage, or motivate an audience, often focusing on personal success, overcoming adversity, or achieving goals. This concept is central to understanding the text stating Lizzie Velasquez is 'now a motivational speaker' and the overall intent of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
