      "description": "The meme frames Lizzie Velasquez as an inspirational figure solely because of her perceived 'overcoming' of her rare genetic condition, reducing her value to her resilience rather than her individuality. This trope is expressed through the text overlay and the visual presentation of her as a motivational speaker.",
