      "description": "The top text overlay 'lizzie velasquez was born with a rare disease' explicitly identifies the visual subject (Lizzie Velasquez) and maps her to the textual concept of being born with a rare disease. This is a direct analogical mapping where the visual entity (Lizzie_Velasquez) is labeled by the text as having the attribute described in the text.",
